{"url": "https://www.douyin.com/video/7633023247184956682", "link": false, "lang": "auto", "local_path": "", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "text": "白宫记者协会晚宴出现了哔哔哔", "end": 2.4}, {"start": 2.4, "text": "这个事儿越来越魔幻了", "end": 4.16}, {"start": 3.66, "text": "I will tell you this speech tonight will be classic Donald J Trump. It'll be funny", "end": 10.14}, {"start": 10.14, "text": "It'll be entertaining. There will be some shots fired tonight", "end": 13.52}, {"start": 15.1, "text": "Everyone should tune in it's gonna be really great. I'm looking forward to hearing it", "end": 18.5}, {"start": 18.84, "text": "白宫发言人莱维特晚宴前公开说", "end": 21.92}, {"start": 21.92, "text": "今晚房间会有枪声", "end": 23.76}, {"start": 23.76, "text": "结果真响了", "end": 24.92}, {"start": 24.92, "text": "老特被紧急疏散", "end": 26.16}, {"start": 26.16, "text": "枪手直接死了", "end": 27.4}, {"start": 27.4, "text": "我看到万斯是先跑的", "end": 29.08}, {"start": 29.12, "text": "老特倒是很淡定", "end": 30.56}, {"start": 30.56, "text": "然后美国人就开始了", "end": 32.08}, {"start": 32.08, "text": "什么自导自演", "end": 33.16}, {"start": 33.16, "text": "苦肉计", "end": 33.72}, {"start": 33.72, "text": "假期行动", "end": 34.64}, {"start": 34.64, "text": "就是阴谋论呗", "end": 35.6}, {"start": 35.6, "text": "对吧", "end": 36.12}, {"start": 36.12, "text": "其实这个事儿根本就不是巧合能解释的", "end": 38.48}, {"start": 38.48, "text": "它只能说明美国政治烂到根则上了", "end": 41.08}, {"start": 41.08, "text": "你看啊", "end": 41.52}, {"start": 41.52, "text": "第一", "end": 42.12}, {"start": 42.12, "text": "语言陷阱加上集团的巧合", "end": 44.32}, {"start": 44.32, "text": "直接就把阴谋论给焊死了", "end": 46.08}, {"start": 46.08, "text": "莱维特那句South Fair的", "end": 47.56}, {"start": 47.56, "text": "英文里本来是互怼发狠话的意思", "end": 49.64}, {"start": 49.64, "text": "就算是一句俚语嘛", "end": 50.72}, {"start": 50.72, "text": "对吧", "end": 51.32}, {"start": 51.32, "text": "他本意是说", "end": 52.44}, {"start": 52.44, "text": "老特今晚的演讲会火力全开", "end": 54.28}, {"start": 54.28, "text": "结果真枪真响了", "end": 55.84}, {"start": 55.84, "text": "这种一语成讯", "end": 57.08}, {"start": 57.92, 